  "about-institute": {
    "title": "BLDEA's A S Patil College of Commerce Vijayapura",
    "url": "https://bldeaspcc.ac.in/about-institute",
    "content": "Home About Institute Towards making our world a better place About the Institute Commerce education plays a significant role in making our world a better place. It prepares future generations for trade, commerce, and business activities and provides an improved livelihood to the people at the bottom of the pyramid by empowering them. Recognising this immense power of commerce education in social transformation, BLDEA established ASP College of Commerce way back in 1961. The college is named after Shri Atalatti Siddanagouda Patil, who made liberal and generous donations for its establishment. The college is affiliated with Rani Channamma University, Belagavi, and recognised under UGC 2(f) and 12(B). NAAC has accredited it with A grade. The college offers three undergraduate courses, namely B.Com, BBA, BCA, and two postgraduate courses, namely MCom and MBA, approved by AICTE. The UGC granted Autonomous Status to the college in 2007 for UG Programme and in 2008 for the PG programme. Many value-added courses are also offered. The college is located in BLDE Association's new campus on Solapur Road and has excellent infrastructure. Of the 24 classrooms, 19 classrooms have information and communication technology facilities. Two seminar halls, a well-stocked library managed by Integrated Library Management System, three laboratories and a hostel for girl students are among the facilities provided. The college has three buses to meet the students' transportation needs. Extensive facilities have been provided for sports activities, and the students have won 13 university blues over the last five years. Equal importance has been given to cultural activities too. Its students regularly participate in inter-college and state-level cultural activities and never fail to make their college proud. The college's NCC and NSS units frequently undertake various extension activities to conserve our environment and benefit people living in the surrounding regions. The college has a student strength of around 1,200 and a strong faculty team, including nine PhD holders and seven MPhil degree holders. The faculty members' dedication is one of the main reasons behind the excellent academic performance produced by the students year after year. The students find support from the management in finding placements too. Over the last five years, more than 300 students have been placed. The academic success of the college lies in its distinct approach to teaching. Every department frames its curriculum and syllabus with a multidisciplinary approach to help students develop problem-solving and other necessary skills required by the industry. The college actively encourages research activities and has published ten research papers over the last five years. Many of its faculty members have received 'Best Research Paper' award for their work. These unique features of the college have made it one of the top-performing institutions in North Karnataka. Courses Offered B.Com BBA BBM M.Com MBA PGDCA Apply Online Download Brochure Request a Call back Submit"
  },
